 hermes_cli/kanban_containment_guard.py        | 36 ++++++-
 hermes_cli/kanban_db.py                       |  8 +-
 hermes_cli/kanban_transfer.py                 |  2 +
 .../test_kanban_containment_retention.py      | 96 +++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 146 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
